        "verdict": "PASS",
        "reasons": "EXECUTABLE is right and the figures are now honest. Every link of the one member is established on the card: three written acceptances at $1,600 from golf courses (inside the only industry the owner named), Brain-proved PRODUCE_SPREADSHEET fulfilment, $20 direct cost, and 10 days to cash. Recomputed: the $60 owner float is booked as FUNDING on day 1, the $60 of cost is spent on day 5, and $4,800 settles on day 15 of 30. Collected is $4,800 (customer cash only), refunds are $0, owner-funded is $60, maximum exposure is $60, minimum cash is $0, and net is $4,740, which clears the $4,000 target. The goal sets no capital limit (capitalCeilingCents null), so the float is inside every limit. Brain's check reports no problems.",
